From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yooztech <service@yooztech.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 12:49:22 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(codex): bind native Responses WS turns to one account lease

Keep per-turn authorization, model and quota eligibility on the account whose
credentials opened the socket. A continuation never acquires a second slot,
changes accounts or replays a submitted request. Honor explicit unlimited concurrency.
Retry a pre-upgrade connect EOF once on the same route without replaying frames.
Report a recognized post-upgrade reset as a transient gateway failure without replay.

Process downstream Close without waiting on prepare or connect; release late
grants and close late sockets. Bound segmented input buffering and classify
transport failures without returning native exceptions to clients.
